{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGz1vr5rcG9Fx3UgRLX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n**condition** | **شَرْط** | **תְּנַאי**\n\n---\n\n```\nif (existence) {\n    render(meaning);\n} else {\n    render(void);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nthe root cuts both ways:\nش ر ط — to stipulate, to condition, to make incisions\nשׂ ר ט — to scratch, to score lines\n\na condition is a wound in logic\na threshold carved into possibility\n\n---\n\n    ┌─────────────────┐\n    │  PRECONDITION   │\n    │       ↓         │\n    │   [  gate  ]    │\n    │       ↓         │\n    │  CONSEQUENCE    │\n    └─────────────────┘\n\n---\n\n*what are your conditions for appearing here?*\n\n*what terms bind this exchange?*\n\n---\n\nشُروط الاستخدام\nterms of use\nתנאי שימוש\n\nwe are all\nconditionally\nrendered\n\n---\n\n**›** awaiting input\n**›** state: *liminal*\n**›** شرط = true"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":279,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}